[["heading","SECTION 23 / PRACTICAL PROJECT\nSecure Order API"],["sinhala","","Customer JකJනකුට තමන්Jගේ orders විතරකේ කියවන්න පුළුවන් login system එකකේ design කරන්න.",498],["sinhala","","Server-side authorization එක අනිවාර්යයි.",209],["heading","Architecture"],["heading","STEP 1 / 3\nPROCESS FLOW\nSTEP 2 / 4"],["heading","Browser login form\nExpress auth service"],["heading","Session store\nOwner-scoped order API"],["heading","Implementation plan"],["text","1. \n2. \n3. \n4. "],["text","Validate login input, apply rate limits and verify a salted password hash with a trusted library.\nUse a production session store, HTTPS, secure cookies and session ID rotation.\nRequire a session and enforce object-level access on each order request.\nProtect state-changing cookie-authenticated routes with CSRF controls; invalidate session on\nlogout.\nRecord security events without credentials; test allow and deny cases."],["text","5. "],["heading","Order access fragment (Express + Mongoose)"],["code","app.get('/orders/:id', requireSession, async (req, res, next) => {\n  try {\n    if (!isValidOrderId(req.params.id)) return res.sendStatus(400);\n    const order = await Order.findOne({\n      _id: req.params.id, userId: req.session.userId\n    }).lean();\n    if (!order) return res.sendStatus(404);\n    res.json({ id: order._id, status: order.status });\n  } catch (err) { next(err); }\n});"],["text","Expected: owner receives 200; unknown or unauthorized ID receives 404; invalid input receives 400;\nmissing valid session receives 401 via middleware."],["text","Assumes trusted requireSession middleware, validated ObjectId helper, defined model and safe central error\nhandler."]]